<view class="page">
  <view class="hero">
    <view class="hero-bg"></view>
    <view class="h-content">
      <view class="h-title">怪兽收养计划</view>
      <view class="h-price">¥ 398<span class="unit"> / 只</span></view>
      <view class="h-sub">首年限量{{total}}只 · 售罄不补</view>
    </view>
    <view class="progress-card">
      <view class="p-row">
        <text class="p-label">已收养</text>
        <text class="p-num">{{total - remain}}<text class="p-total"> / {{total}}只</text></text>
      </view>
      <view class="p-wrap">
        <view class="p-fill" style="width:{{(1 - remain/total)*100}}%;"></view>
      </view>
      <view class="p-remain">还剩 <text class="r-n">{{remain}}</text> 只 · 先到先得</view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="section">
    <view class="h-row"><text class="h-bar" style="background:#6B8E4E;"></text><text class="h-title">每收养一只怪兽，种一棵白茶树</text></view>
    <view class="tree-desc">
      怪兽不只是一件摆件——它对应安吉后山上的一棵白茶树。树牌上写着怪兽的名字和您的居民编号，您可以每年回家"看它"。
    </view>
    <view class="tree-row">
      <view class="t-col">
        <text class="t-num">{{total - remain}}</text>
        <text class="t-l">已种茶树</text>
      </view>
      <view class="t-col">
        <text class="t-num">{{remain}}</text>
        <text class="t-l">剩余名额</text>
      </view>
      <view class="t-col">
        <text class="t-num">4-6周</text>
        <text class="t-l">怪兽邮寄到家</text>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="section">
    <view class="h-row"><text class="h-bar" style="background:#C9A961;"></text><text class="h-title">收养包含</text></view>
    <view class="incl">
      <view class="i-item">✓ 独1只陶土小怪兽（主理人捏塑+您命名）</view>
      <view class="i-item">✓ 白茶树种植 + 专属树牌</view>
      <view class="i-item">✓ 怪兽收养证书（编号+签名）</view>
      <view class="i-item">✓ 居民证升级 & 推荐权益升级</view>
      <view class="i-item">✓ 每年"回家看它"入住9折礼遇</view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="section">
    <view class="h-row"><text class="h-bar" style="background:#A67C52;"></text><text class="h-title">已收养的怪兽们（部分）</text></view>
    <view class="story-wall">
      <view class="story-item" wx:for="{{stories}}" wx:key="id">
        <view class="s-icon" style="background:{{item.color}}22;color:{{item.color}};">{{item.initial}}</view>
        <view class="s-name">No.{{item.no}} · {{item.name}}</view>
        <view class="s-owner">{{item.owner}}</view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="safe-bottom"></view>
  <view class="bottom-bar">
    <view class="p"><text class="n">¥398</text><text class="u">/ 只</text></view>
    <button class="btn-primary b-btn {{remain === 0 ? 'btn-disabled' : ''}}" bindtap="adopt" disabled="{{remain === 0}}">
      {{remain === 0 ? '已售罄' : '立即收养'}}
    </button>
  </view>
</view>
